00:32:48.132 --> 00:32:49.100
DETERMINED THE DEPARTMENT

00:32:49.167 --> 00:32:49.967
PERFORMED SATISFACTORILY WHEN

00:32:50.034 --> 00:32:52.136
MAKING SCREENING DECISIONS

00:32:52.203 --> 00:32:53.171
POORLY AND COMPLETING INQUIRIES

00:32:53.237 --> 00:32:56.140
AND POORLY IN CONDUCTING

00:32:56.207 --> 00:32:57.041
INVESTIGATIONS AND IN THE

